cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StatNext in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "StatNext: point-and-click statistics with reproducible R code"
abstract: >-
  StatNext is a free desktop statistics application for Windows, macOS and Linux.
  Analyses are chosen from menus and computed by a local R installation; every
  result is returned together with the plain R code that produced it, so analyses
  can be reproduced outside the application. Plots are drawn with the ggnext R
  package and results include plain-language summaries from easystats.
authors:
  - given-names: Mahesh
    family-names: Divakaran
version: 0.5.1
date-released: 2026-11-18
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/itsmdivakaran/statz"
url: "https://itsmdivakaran.github.io/statz/"
keywords:
  - statistics
  - R
  - reproducibility
  - desktop application
  - data analysis
  - biostatistics
